category: Libs
build-depends: cygport gettext-devel intltool libglib2.0-devel libintl-devel
sdesc: "Library for reading DBF files (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "This is a C library to read DBF files. The code is originally from
https://sourceforge.net/projects/dbf.berlios/. While the dbf code from that
source compiles just fine, the underlying library doesn't."
